11:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"type"}],": 逻辑数据类型（String、List、Hash、Set、ZSet）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"encoding"}],": 物理编码格式（int、row、listpack、skiplist）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"lru"}],": 淘汰策略数据，如果是 LRU 模式，则存储最后一次访问的时间戳（秒级）。如果是 LFU 模式，则存储方法时间和访问频率。当内存达到 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"maxmemory"}]," 时，Redis 根据此字段决定淘汰哪个 Key。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"iskvobj"}],": Redis 8.0 的新特性。",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}]," 表示该对象是一个 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"kvobj"}]," （键值对象）的一部分，意味着 Key、Value 和元数据在内存中是紧凑/内嵌存储的。这样可以消除\"键值分离\"带来的指针跳转，提升 CPU 缓存命中率。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"expirable"}],": Redis8.0 的新特性。",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}]," 表示该 Key 设置了过期时间。这提供了一条快速通道，访问时若为 0，直接跳过查询 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"expires"}]," 哈希表的步骤，节省昂贵的哈希查找开销。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"refcount"}],": 记录有多少个指针引用了该对象。用于内存管理和对象共享（主要用于小整数共享）。当计数降为 0 时，回收内存。这里使用了位域压缩以节省空间。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-6",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ptr"}],": 指向实际存储数据的内存地址（如 SDS、Dict、Quicklist 的地址）。特别地，如果 encoding 是 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"INT"}],"，这里直接存储整数值本身，不再是指针。"]}],"\n"]}]
12:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["上述多个字段，最重要的就是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"type"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"encoding"}],"。总的来说，",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"type"}]," 决定了它对外声称是什么（比如 Hash），而 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"encoding"}]," 决定了它在内存里到底怎么存（比如是压缩列表还是哈希表）。",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["优化 Redis 内存的核心，就是想办法让它保持在轻量级的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"encoding"}]," 上。"]}]]}]
