79:["$","p","p-50",{"children":["它将每个 (member, score) 对紧凑地序列化存储。为了保持有序，每次插入都需要找到正确的位置，这可能导致其后的数据发生移动。当 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"N"}]," 非常小（例如小于 128）时，𝑂(𝑁) 的操作成本极低，几乎是瞬时的，而节省下来的内存却非常可观。"]}]
7a:["$","p","p-51",{"children":["一旦 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"listpack"}]," 的任一触发条件被打破，Redis 会自动将其转换为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"skiplist"}]," + ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"dict"}]," 编码。其实 ZSet 要采用\"双引擎\"模式，也不难理解，它要解决的核心矛盾是：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"如何创建一个既能通过成员（member）快速查找、又能根据分数（score）高效排序和范围查找的数据集合？"}]]}]
7b:["$","ul","ul-14",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"dict"}]," (字典/哈希表)"]}],"：负责\"集合\"的部分。它建立了一个从 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"member"}]," 到 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"score"}]," 的映射。这使得 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ZSCORE"}]," 这种通过成员获取分数的操作，时间复杂度 𝑂(1)。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"skiplist"}]," (跳表)"]}],"：负责\"排序\"的部分。它将所有的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"(score, member)"}]," 对按照 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"score"}],"（分数相同则按 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"member"}]," 字典序）进行排序。跳表的特性使得插入、删除和按排名/分数范围查找的平均时间复杂度都是 𝑂(𝑙𝑜𝑔𝑁)。"]}],"\n"]}]
7c:["$","blockquote","blockquote-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["为了节约内存，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"dict"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"skiplist"}]," 中的 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"member"}]," 字符串是共享的，即它们都指向同一个 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SDS (Simple Dynamic String)"}]," 对象。"]}],"\n"]}]
