c3:["$","p","p-90",{"children":"Bloom Filter（布隆过滤器）是由 Burton Howard Bloom 于 1970 年提出的，它是一种 space efficient 的概率型数据结构，用于判断一个元素是否在集合中。通常用于快速判断某个元素是否可能存在于一个大型数据集中，而无需实际存储整个数据集。"}]
c4:["$","p","p-91",{"children":["在 Redis 8 之后，Bloom Filter 已经内置在 Redis 中了。在这之前，它不是 Redis 的标准功能，而是通过 Redis 4.0+ 引入 Module 插件机制安装的，详细可参考 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://github.com/RedisBloom/RedisBloom","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://github.com/RedisBloom/RedisBloom"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub 丨 RedisBloom","position":{"start":{"line":1105,"column":104,"offset":39722},"end":{"line":1105,"column":123,"offset":39741}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1105,"column":103,"offset":39721},"end":{"line":1105,"column":166,"offset":39784}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"GitHub 丨 RedisBloom"}],"。"]}]
