ed:["$","ul","ul-28",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"普通频道订阅关系表"}],"。Key 是频道名 (Channel)，Value 是一个链表，存储了所有订阅该频道的客户端 (Clients)。对应 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SUBSCRIBE"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"PUBLISH"}]," 命令。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["在 Redis 7.0 之前，这里是一个 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"dict *"}],"（字典）。但在新版本中，它升级为了 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"kvstore *"}]}],"。在 Redis Cluster 模式下，普通的 Pub/Sub 是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"广播"}],"的（一个节点收到消息，会转发给集群内所有节点）。",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"kvstore"}]," 是 Redis 内部对\"支持分槽（Slot）的字典\"的抽象。虽然普通的 Pub/Sub 是广播的，但使用 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"kvstore"}]," 统一了内部的数据结构接口，方便管理和扩容。"]}],"\n"]}]
