ef:["$","ul","ul-29",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"模式订阅关系表"}],"。Key 是匹配模式 (Pattern，如 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"news.*"}],")，Value 是订阅了该模式的客户端列表。对应 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"PSUBSCRIBE"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"PPUBLISH"}]," 命令。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["当有消息发布到 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"news.sports"}]," 频道时，Redis 不仅要查 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pubsub_channels"}],"，还要遍历这个 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"pubsub_patterns"}]," 字典，看 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"news.sports"}]," 是否匹配其中的模式。"]}],"\n"]}]
f0:["$","p","p-115",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"int notify_keyspace_events"}],":"]}]
f1:["$","ul","ul-30",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"键空间通知配置"}],"。这是一个",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Bitmask (位掩码)"}]," 整数。对应 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"redis.conf"}]," 配置中的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"notify-keyspace-events"}],"（如 \"Ex\" 代表过期事件）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["Redis 的键空间通知（Keyspace Notifications）本质上就是利用 Pub/Sub 机制实现的。当一个 Key 被修改或过期时，如果这个掩码中对应的位被置为 1，Redis 就会自动向特定的频道（如 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"__keyevent@0__:expired"}],"）发送一条 Pub/Sub 消息。"]}],"\n"]}]
f2:["$","p","p-116",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"kvstore *pubsubshard_channels"}],":"]}]
f3:["$","ul","ul-31",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"分片频道订阅关系表 (Sharded Pub/Sub)"}],"。对应 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SSUBSCRIBE"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"SPUBLISH"}]," 命令 (Redis 7.0 新增)。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["普通的 Pub/Sub 在集群中是",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"全量广播"}],"的。你在节点 A 发布消息，节点 A 会把它转发给 B、C、D... 即使 B、C、D 上根本没有客户端订阅这个频道。这造成了巨大的网络带宽浪费（写放大）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Sharded Pub/Sub"}]," 将频道名通过 Hash 算法映射到具体的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Slot (槽)"}],"，就像普通的 Key 一样。消息只会被发送到",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"持有该 Slot 的节点"}],"，不再全网广播。这里的**",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"kvstore"}],"** 发挥了关键作用：它能根据 Slot 快速索引和管理频道。这是 Redis 7.0 针对集群 Pub/Sub 性能优化的一大体现。"]}],"\n"]}]
f4:["$","p","p-117",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"unsigned int pubsub_clients"}],":"]}]
f5:["$","ul","ul-32",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"当前的 Pub/Sub 客户端总数"}],"。用于 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"INFO"}]," 命令统计和监控。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"Redis 需要知道当前有多少个连接处于\"订阅状态\"，因为处于订阅状态的客户端，其 socket 读取逻辑和普通客户端略有不同（只能发送订阅相关命令）。"}],"\n"]}]
f6:["$","blockquote","blockquote-8",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"garden-callout-marker garden-callout-marker--warning","aria-hidden":"true"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["注意，虽然 Pub/Sub 不保存消息，但是为了保证把消息推给（在线的）订阅者，会把积压的消息暂时存在该订阅者 Client 的 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"输出缓冲区 (Output Buffer)"}]," 中。如果消费者处理得很慢，导致积压越来越多，这个缓冲区会无限膨胀，最终 OOM。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["Redis 默认配置了保护策略 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"client-output-buffer-limit"}],"：如果缓冲区超过 32MB，或者持续 60 秒超过 8MB，Redis 会",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"强制断开"}],"这个订阅者的连接。订阅者断连，消息丢失，但 Redis 活下来了。"]}],"\n"]}]
